{%- set page = nav.pages['about'] -%}
{{ page_header(page, 'About CholeraFlow and this offline report.') }}
<p>CholeraFlow is a Nextflow pipeline for <em>Vibrio cholerae</em> genomic surveillance and outbreak investigation.</p>
<p>This explorer presents supplied pipeline outputs; it does not perform a new genomic analysis. Runtime assets are embedded, with no telemetry or external requests.</p>
<h3>Asset licences and attribution</h3><p>Lucide icons: ISC, with Feather portions under MIT. Inter and JetBrains Mono: SIL Open Font License 1.1. Workflow artwork and brand motifs are original CholeraFlow illustrations.</p>
{% for licence in assets.licences %}<details class="cf-disclosure"><summary>{{ licence.file }}</summary><pre class="cf-pre">{{ licence.text }}</pre></details>{% endfor %}
{{ page_footer(page) }}
